  "description": "DAVPAV crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H66 Gd12 N6 O78,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1O (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2O (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1P (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2P (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1Q (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2Q (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.683-3.854 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.87-109.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd12(HL)6(L)6(NO3)6(H2O)12]·6H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 12 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
